      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Square to 360, then seam repair (efficient)\nUpload a square source image. The outpaint pass makes a 2048x1024 ERP.\nThe second pass centers the wrap boundary, repairs a 512px band, then restores orientation.\nThe 4K output is Lanczos resized once at the end, not newly generated detail.\nCLIP device is set to default (GPU). Seam denoise 0.8, steps 14.\n\n**Comfy Cloud version:** Panorama-Stickers replaced.\n1. Open erp_control_maker.html locally, load the square photo, save the 2048x1024 PNG.\n2. Upload that PNG to the 'Upload ERP control image' node.\n- First-pass prompt must start with the LoRA trigger text (kept in node 6).\n- Seam shift = crop halves + swap; seam mask = SolidMask + MaskComposite (+ FeatherMask 128px)."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Square to 360, then seam repair (efficient)\nUpload a square source image. The outpaint pass makes a 2048x1024 ERP.\nThe second pass centers the wrap boundary, repairs a 512px band, then restores orientation.\nThe 4K output is Lanczos resized once at the end, not newly generated detail.\nCLIP device is set to default (GPU). Seam denoise 0.8, steps 14.\n\n**Comfy Cloud version:** Panorama-Stickers replaced.\n1. Open erp_control_maker.html locally, load the square photo, save the 2048x1024 PNG.\n2. Upload that PNG to the 'Upload ERP control image' node.\n- First-pass prompt must start with the LoRA trigger text (kept in node 6).\n- Seam shift = crop halves + swap; seam mask = SolidMask + MaskComposite (+ FeatherMask 128px)."
      },
      "color": "#323",
      "bgcolor": "#535"
    },
